{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PlanetInfoCard"},{"type":"text","text":"를 사용하면서 태양계를 그리는 화면을 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RealityView"},{"type":"text","text":"로 옮깁니다. 지름 정규화, 장면 생성과 갱신, 이름 레이블, 공간 탭을 순서대로 연결합니다."}],"url":"\/tutorials\/solarsystematlas\/04-realitykitintegration#%EC%97%94%ED%8B%B0%ED%8B%B0%EC%9D%98-%EC%9D%B4%EB%A6%84%EA%B3%BC-%ED%81%AC%EA%B8%B0-%ED%86%B5%EC%9D%BC%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0","title":"엔티티의 이름과 크기 통일하기","kind":"section","role":"pseudoSymbol","type":"section"},"02-orbit-rotation.swift":{"fileName":"PlanetOrbitView.swift","fileType":"swift","identifier":"02-orbit-rotation.swift","syntax":"swift","highlights":[{"line":21},{"line":22},{"line":23},{"line":24},{"line":25},{"line":26},{"line":27},{"line":28},{"line":31},{"line":32},{"line":33},{"line":34},{"line":35}],"content":["import SwiftUI","","struct PlanetOrbitView: View {","    let planet: Planet","    let time: TimeInterval","","    private var orbitAngle: Angle {","        let progress = time.truncatingRemainder(","            dividingBy: planet.orbitDuration","        ) \/ planet.orbitDuration","        return .degrees(progress * 360)","    }","","    private var spinAngle: Angle {","        let progress = time.truncatingRemainder(","            dividingBy: planet.rotationDuration","        ) \/ planet.rotationDuration","        return .degrees(progress * 360 * planet.rotationDirection)","    }","","    private var orbitX: CGFloat {","        CGFloat(cos(orbitAngle.radians)) * planet.orbitRadius","    }","","    private var orbitDepth: CGFloat {","        CGFloat(sin(orbitAngle.radians)) * planet.orbitRadius","    }","","    var body: some View {","        PlanetModelView(assetName: planet.assetName)","            \/\/ 자전은 모델에만 적용합니다.","            .rotation3DLayout(spinAngle, axis: .y)","            \/\/ 공전 위치는 자전과 분리하고, 앞 장의 z축 이동량을 더합니다.","            .offset(x: orbitX, y: -orbitDepth * 0.3)","            .offset(z: planet.depth + orbitDepth * 0.6)","    }","}"],"type":"file"},"doc://co.kr.youngmin.SolarSystemAtlas.step-by-step.documentation/tutorials/SolarSystemAtlas/01-SpatialLayoutBasics#%EA%B9%8A%EC%9D%B4%EB%A5%BC-%EB%A0%88%EC%9D%B4%EC%95%84%EC%9B%83%EC%9D%98-%EC%9D%BC%EB%B6%80%EB%A1%9C-%EB%A7%8C%EB%93%A4%EA%B8%B0":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/co.kr.youngmin.SolarSystemAtlas.step-by-step.documentation\/tutorials\/SolarSystemAtlas\/01-SpatialLayoutBasics#%EA%B9%8A%EC%9D%B4%EB%A5%BC-%EB%A0%88%EC%9D%B4%EC%95%84%EC%9B%83%EC%9D%98-%EC%9D%BC%EB%B6%80%EB%A1%9C-%EB%A7%8C%EB%93%A4%EA%B8%B0","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Xcode에서 새 visionOS 프로젝트를 만드는 것부터 시작합니다. RealityKitContent 에셋과 Swift 파일을 차례로 준비한 뒤, 태양과 여덟 행성을 불러와 깊이 축에 배치합니다."}],"url":"\/tutorials\/solarsystematlas\/01-spatiallayoutbasics#%EA%B9%8A%EC%9D%B4%EB%A5%BC-%EB%A0%88%EC%9D%B4%EC%95%84%EC%9B%83%EC%9D%98-%EC%9D%BC%EB%B6%80%EB%A1%9C-%EB%A7%8C%EB%93%A4%EA%B8%B0","title":"깊이를 레이아웃의 일부로 만들기","kind":"section","role":"pseudoSymbol","type":"section"},"doc://co.kr.youngmin.SolarSystemAtlas.step-by-step.documentation/tutorials/SolarSystemAtlas/01-SpatialLayoutBasics#%ED%8A%9C%ED%86%A0%EB%A6%AC%EC%96%BC-%ED%8C%8C%EC%9D%BC-%EA%B5%AC%EC%A1%B0-%EB%A7%8C%EB%93%A4%EA%B8%B0":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/co.kr.youngmin.SolarSystemAtlas.step-by-step.documentation\/tutorials\/SolarSystemAtlas\/01-SpatialLayoutBasics#%ED%8A%9C%ED%86%A0%EB%A6%AC%EC%96%BC-%ED%8C%8C%EC%9D%BC-%EA%B5%AC%EC%A1%B0-%EB%A7%8C%EB%93%A4%EA%B8%B0","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Xcode에서 새 visionOS 프로젝트를 만드는 것부터 시작합니다. RealityKitContent 에셋과 Swift 파일을 차례로 준비한 뒤, 태양과 여덟 행성을 불러와 깊이 축에 배치합니다."}],"url":"\/tutorials\/solarsystematlas\/01-spatiallayoutbasics#%ED%8A%9C%ED%86%A0%EB%A6%AC%EC%96%BC-%ED%8C%8C%EC%9D%BC-%EA%B5%AC%EC%A1%B0-%EB%A7%8C%EB%93%A4%EA%B8%B0","title":"튜토리얼 파일 구조 만들기","kind":"section","role":"pseudoSymbol","type":"section"},"02-model-sized.swift":{"fileName":"PlanetModelView.swift","fileType":"swift","identifier":"02-model-sized.swift","syntax":"swift","highlights":[{"line":23},{"line":24}],"content":["import SwiftUI","import RealityKit","i